  "notes": "Silkscreen spellings placed first in functions (RST, 3V3.1, 0, 17, ..., SCK, MO, MI, RX, TX, 3V3.2, BAT, En, SCL, SDA). Left pin 4 silkscreen is a blank white bar; label GND from the callout. Duplicate callout text equal to the silkscreen (RX, TX, SCL, SDA) not repeated. 2-pin VBAT battery connector (only +/- marks per pin) skipped. RGB LED, blue LED, ambient light sensor, battery voltage and 5V detect callouts are internal signals."
